rst."},"placeBid(uint8,uint64)":{"notice":"Escrow ETH for any Squeek of `wantLevel`."},"withdraw()":{"notice":"Withdraw ETH that could not be delivered when an order filled."}},"notice":"Peer-to-peer trading of Squeeks, built around finding a merge partner.  - Sell:  list a Squeek for ETH. It stays in your wallet until someone buys it.  - Swap:  offer your Squeek for a specific Squeek, or for any Squeek of a level.  - Bid:   escrow ETH for any Squeek of a level (\"I need a Level 3 to merge\"). Ownerless and fee-free: no admin, no pause, no upgrade, no protocol fee. Creator royalties set by the collection (ERC-2981) are paid on ETH sales, capped at 10%. Payments that cannot be delivered are credited and can be withdrawn later.","version":1}},"settings":{"compilationTarget":{"src/MergeMarket.sol":"MergeMarket"},"evmVersion":"cancun","libraries":{},"metadata":{"bytecodeHash":"ipfs"},"optimizer":{"enabled":true,"runs":200},"remappings":[":@openzeppelin/contracts/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/contracts/",":forge-std/=lib/forge-std/src/",":openzeppelin-contracts/=lib/openzeppelin-contracts/"]},"sources":{"src/MergeMarket.sol":{"keccak256":"0xde74bfd95809660b2e45db7f3871e83b8d5484c65cb39c73cb5e90cd3e2ea3e3","license":"MIT","urls":["bzz-raw://f77c7d05ed368e24f1850551e571de1850be66e35f72456ef0d42a8389a9a797","dweb:/ipfs/QmPx18a1kRiMwNtwQ5x8wYFsrUYGxm4QRDCN9f4Xj1U1fA"]}},"version":1}